msgid ""
"<strong>Read in the background.</strong> Tally is read by a background job, one file or\n"
"                            one month at a time, with a progress bar: you can close the browser. Big files are read\n"
"                            piece by piece. Then check and post everything at once."
msgstr ""

#. module: om_tally_account
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_tally_account.om_tally_import_view_form_account
msgid ""
"<strong>Recommended.</strong> The opening balances on the cut-over date, with every open\n"
"                            bill of the customers and vendors, is the best way to move to Odoo: the books start\n"
"                            clean, ageing and follow-ups work from day one, and the import takes minutes. Keep the\n"
"                            older years in Tally for reference."
msgstr ""

#. module: om_tally_account
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_tally_account.om_tally_import_view_form_account
msgid ""
"<strong>Split by period.</strong> Import one financial year (or any period) at a time:\n"
"                            set the period, read it (with files: add the export of that period only), check and\n"
"                            post it, then use Next Period. Each run adds to the previous ones; vouchers already\n"
"                            imported are never doubled."
msgstr ""

